{{Debuffnotes
| name = Macropyre
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} All ability effects now affect [[debuff immune]] units.
}}

 {{Jakirocard}}

* {{Symbol|Attack Modifier}}
** Liquid Frost is an active attack modifier, and has the following properties:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|[[Cast Range|CastRange]] {{=}} Hero[[Attack Range|AtkRange]]}}
*** Specifically affected by {{M|attack range}} sources of the same range-type as the caster.
** Has a different cast range when casting Liquid Frost manually; {{M|Autocast}} uses Jakiro's current {{M|attack range|x}}.
*** Has Autocast off by default.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}} {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*** Applies all ability effects as long as the attack modifier {{M|projectile}} impacts, regardless if the attack {{M|missed}} or is {{M|disjointed}}.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
*** This ability component can be applied by other [[instant attack]] sources.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Does not apply at all if the enemy unit is affected by the following sources prior projectile impact:
*** {{M|Invulnerable}} sources.
*** {{M|Spell immune}} sources.

* The ability effects are applied as follows:
*# {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}}
*#* Applies first {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}}.
*# {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|jakiro_liquid_ice_debuff}}
*#* Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration.
*# The damage procs ability component then react on all damage instance sourced to Jakiro on the same {{M|server tick}}, except from the following sources:
*#* Jakiro's {{M|Summons|text=player-controlled units}}.
*#* [[No-reflection flag]]
*#* {{M|HP Removal}} sources.
*#* The {{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{ValueColor||max health as damage per second|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4r}} ability component.
*#* Explicitly the following item abilities:
*#** {{A|Radiance|Burn}}
*#** {{A|Cloak of Flames|Immolate}}
*#** {{A|Blood Grenade|Throw Grenade}}
*#** {{I|Urn of Shadows}}-based items
*# {{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{Symbol|Dot|On}} {{Symbol|Dot|Off}} ... {{Symbol|Dot|Off}} {{Symbol|Dot|Off}}
*#* {{cf|talnotes}} Deals {{Code|Max[[Health|HP]] × {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Liquid Frost basic1}}|v1={{#var:Liquid Frost value5 tal}}}}|tal|x}}}} {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Liquid Frost basic1}}-second intervals, starting {{#var:Liquid Frost basic1}} seconds after debuff application, over {{#expr:{{#var:Liquid Frost value4}}/{{#var:Liquid Frost basic1}}}} damage instances per full debuff duration.
*# Jakiro's attack instance.

* Cannot be cast on the following units:
** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

