 * {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** Jakiro always attempts to apply {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Fire}} and/or {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Frost}} whenever applicable.
** {{Symbol|Attack Damage}}
*** Reduces both the {{M|Main Attack Damage|text=main}} and {{M|Bonus Attack Damage|text=bonus}} attack damage.
*** Does not affect bonus {{M|conditional attack damage}}.
*** Stacks additively with other total attack damage reduction sources.

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Hence, the ability effects are applied as follows on the attacked enemy unit:
**# Both {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Frost}}'s first damage and the {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|jakiro_liquid_ice_debuff}}.
**# The [[File:Jakiro Ice Head Innate abilityicon dota2 wikiasset.png|21px|Ice Head]] Ice Head attack instance.
**#* This instance applies the {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Frost}} proc damage.
**# {{Symbol|Attack Damage|Instant}}
**#* Procs Double Trouble with the [[File:Jakiro Fire Head Innate abilityicon dota2 wikiasset.png|21px|Fire Head]] Fire Head's [[instant attack]] instance.
**#** Procs any {{M|attack modifiers}} and {{M|on-cast effects}} as per normal, except {{M|cleave}}.
**#** Does not have {{M|True Strike}}.
**#** Does not interacts with the following sources:
**#*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**#**** {{M|Disable}} sources.
**#**** {{M|Disarm}} sources.
**#*** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**#**** {{M|Damage block}} sources.
**#* The instant attack instance also reapplies the {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Frost}} proc damage.
**# The {{A|Jakiro|Liquid Fire}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|jakiro_liquid_fire_burn}} debuff.

* {{cf|expr}}
** Total {{M|attack damage}} factor: {{Code|SelfΣ[[Attack Damage|AtkDmg]] × ({{#var:Double Trouble value2}} + {{#var:Double Trouble basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Double Trouble icon0}}
| desc = Jakiro's attacks launch an attack from each head, but deal less damage each.
}}
* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** Has the following attack animation priorities:
*** [[File:Jakiro Ice Head Innate abilityicon dota2 wikiasset.png|21px|Ice Head]] Ice Head {{to}} [[File:Jakiro Fire Head Innate abilityicon dota2 wikiasset.png|21px|Fire Head]] Fire Head

