{{Debuffnotes
| name = Macropyre
| desc = {{Symbol|bonus agh}} All ability effects now affect [[debuff immune]] units.
}}

 * [[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre Visualization icon-1.png|84px|]][[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre Visualization icon-2.png|84px|]][[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre Visualization icon-3.png|84px|]]
** {{Symbol|Target|Area-Dummy}}
*** Creates {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:floor(({{#var:Macropyre cast range}}+{{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2)/({{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2))}} negative {{M|aura}} cells immediately within the area-of-effect and affecting enemy units over the whole distance upon cast.
*** {{M|Cast range}} increasing sources increase the number of cells.
*** {{M|Area-of-effect}} sources reduce the number of cells unless the path distance increases as well.
** {{hi|Jakiro}} [[File:Dota2 Letter-o.png|21px|O]] {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} [[File:Dota2 Pto.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 LtoL.png|21px]][[File:Dota2 toP.png|21px]] [[File:Dota2 Letter-s.png|21px|S]]
*** {{cf|expr}}
**** {{Code|[[wikipedia:Radius|r]](P) {{=}} PathWidth / 2 {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2}}}}
**** {{Code|Number of Cells {{=}} [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]] ( [[Cast Range|CastRange]] + r(P) ) / r(P) [[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌋]]}}
***** {{Code|PP' {{=}} CastRange / Number of Cells {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Macropyre cast range}}/floor(({{#var:Macropyre cast range}}+{{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2)/({{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2)) round2}}-distance}}
**** {{Code|OS {{=}} CastRange + r(P) {{=}} {{#expr:{{#var:Macropyre cast range}}+{{#var:Macropyre value1}}/2}}}}

* {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|jakiro_macropyre_burn}}
** Applies the debuff on valid enemy units in {{#var:Macropyre basic1}}-second intervals.
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes its duration, and continue applying its {{M|spell damage}} in the same intervals as the first cast.
*** {{cf|talnotes}} Hence, the {{ValueColor||damage increasing|20tal}} {{M|talent|t=t3l}} does not update the current active instance.
** Deals {{calc|v1*{{#var:Macropyre basic1}}|v1={{#var:Macropyre value3}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t3l}} {{ValueColor||{{calc|v1*{{#var:Macropyre basic1}}|v1={{#var:Macropyre value3 tal}}}}|20tal}}) {{M|magical|x}} ({{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{M|pure}}) {{M|spell damage}} in {{#var:Macropyre basic1}}-second intervals, starting immediately upon debuff application, over {{#expr:{{#var:Macropyre value5}}/{{#var:Macropyre basic1}}+1}} damage instances.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}} Creates two {{ValueColor||{{#var:Macropyre type2 value2 agh}}|agh}}-radius ice walls on both sides of the Macropyre, parallel to each other {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Macropyre value1 agh}}-{{#var:Macropyre type2 value1 agh}}*{{#var:Macropyre type2 value2 agh}}}}|agh}}-distance apart each other with the flames in between.
** [[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre agh Visualization icon-1.png|105px|]][[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre agh Visualization icon-2.png|105px|]][[File:Dota2 Jakiro Macropyre agh Visualization icon-3.png|105px|]]
*** These ice walls that applies {{M|movement speed}} slow are always created in the same formation, on top of the increased path width.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The ability checks if Jakiro has the {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} upon cast.
*** Hence, acquiring the item immediately updates the [[damage type]] of the current active instance, but does not create the ice walls.
** Affects the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Macropyre icon0}}
